# Dependencies
node_modules

# Build output. `dist` is deliberately NOT ignored: consumers install this
# package with `bun add github:kareyes/aether-forms`, which clones the repo
# instead of unpacking an npm tarball, so the built output has to be committed
# for the `exports` paths to resolve. Rebuild it with `bun run package`.
build
.svelte-kit
.output
*.tgz

